  {
   "kind": "fact",
   "text": "The microwave oven began with a melted candy bar. Engineer Percy Spencer stood near a radar part called a magnetron and found the candy in his pocket had melted.",
   "topic": "inventions",
   "note": "This story is widely told, but details such as the exact candy bar vary between accounts.",
   "sources": [
    {
     "url": "https://www.invent.org/blog/inventors/microwave",
