   "kind": "fact",
   "text": "Braille, the reading system used by blind people worldwide, was invented by a teenager. Louis Braille developed his six-dot system in 1824, when he was 15.",
   "topic": "inventions",
   "note": "He built on an earlier dot code by Charles Barbier.",
